flowchart TB
 U[Customer] -->|HTTPS| E[CDN and WAF]
 E -->|Origin HTTPS| L[Load balancer]
 L --> G[API Gateway - auth and bounded admission]
 G -->|Sync browse and quote| C[Catalogue and Sale]
 G -->|Sync| A[Cart]
 G -->|Sync purchase| X[Checkout facade]
 G -->|Sync status| O[Order]
 C <--> R[(Redis advisory cache)]
 C --> CD[(Catalogue DB)]
 A --> AD[(Cart DB)]
 X -->|Sync reserve and begin-checkout| I[Inventory and Reservation]
 X -->|Sync start same intent| P[Payment]
 subgraph stock [Inventory consistency boundary]
 I --> ID[(Inventory DB - holds, dedup, inbox, outbox)]
 end
 subgraph pay [Payment idempotency boundary]
 P --> PD[(Payment DB - intent and outbox)]
 P -->|HTTPS create or lookup| PG[External payment provider]
 end
 ID -.->|Relay CheckoutStarted / ReservationCommitted| K[(Kafka + retry + DLQ)]
 PD -.->|Relay PaymentSucceeded or Failed| K
 K -.->|CheckoutStarted| P
 K -.->|Payment outcome| I
 subgraph recovery [Order recovery boundary]
 K -.->|ReservationCommitted| O
 O --> OD[(Order DB - inbox, order, outbox)]
 end
 OD -.->|Relay OrderConfirmed| K
 K -.-> F[Fulfilment and Shipment]
 K -.-> N[Notification]
 F --> FD[(Shipment DB)]
 N --> ND[(Notification DB)]
 F -->|HTTPS| SH[External carrier]
 N -->|HTTPS| NP[External email and SMS]
 F -.->|ShipmentUpdated via outbox| K
 G -.->|Telemetry| T[Metrics logs traces]
 I -.->|Telemetry| T
 P -.->|Telemetry| T
 O -.->|Telemetry| T
